#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="movie" content-type="movie" tvg-tmdb="490037" tvg-description="Category : Not suitable for Children (R).  Small town in the 1930's... Four inseparable friends who like to be called "a gang" (el clan)...Ricardo is an ambitious shoeshine boy; Amador likes to take part in illegal bare-fist fights in ship's holds; Marcelo always wanted to be an accountant but ended up as a mortuary cosmetician and Antonio is a mechanic whose greatest weakness is other men's wives. Their lives will change forever when they accept tempting offer of a better life. A mysterious stranger offers them a dangerous job which is about to bring a twist to their lives and take them on a journey with no return." director="Jaime Falero" cast="Francisco Vera, Borja Elgea, Octavi Pujades" tvg-logo="https://picture.dens.tv/poster/files/port/1488335961_port.jpg" group-title="Action",El clan
